# PICK provisional (2026-10-09 specials pass): Kamehameha charge. XV2 skill 000_GOK_KMH BAC 12 cups the hands f0-40 and holds.
# Lua counts the charge (hold B), shield stores it, release picks the tier. No damaging fighter hitbox; the charge orb is
# the KameOrb article (article 3, no hitbox, 7-frame life), re-spawned every 5 frames at the cupped hands while the state lasts.
PUT ANIM_RATE 1.0
clear_hitboxes
wait 2
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait 5
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait 5
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait 5
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait 5
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait 5
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait 5
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait 5
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait 5
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait 5
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait 5
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait 5
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait 5
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait 5
CALL geno.article.spawn 3
wait_until 80
